            "heading": "What does DTF stand for?",
            "icon": "check_mark",
            "row_content": "<p>DTF stands for <strong>Direct to Film</strong>. The artwork is printed onto transfer film before being heat pressed onto the final garment.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_a6KpY8": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Can DTF transfers be used on cotton?",
            "icon": "check_mark",
            "row_content": "<p>Yes. DTF is commonly used for cotton apparel as well as many polyester and blended fabrics.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_WJWDiY": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Can DTF transfers be used on dark shirts?",
            "icon": "check_mark",
            "row_content": "<p><br/>Yes. DTF printing uses a white ink underbase, which helps full-color designs remain visible and vibrant on dark garments.<br/><br/></p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_NxQiHX": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Do DTF transfers require weeding?",
            "icon": "check_mark",
            "row_content": "<p>No. Ready-to-press DTF transfers do not require the manual weeding commonly associated with heat transfer vinyl.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_cAXntw": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Do I need a heat press?",
            "icon": "check_mark",
            "row_content": "<p>A quality heat press provides consistent heat and pressure and is the recommended tool for reliable application.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_D87PBx": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Are DTF transfers good for small businesses?",
            "icon": "check_mark",
            "row_content": "<p>They can be especially useful for small apparel businesses because you can produce multiple designs and quantities without setting up screens for every graphic.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_E6tMik": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Ready to Create Your Own DTF Transfers?",
            "icon": "check_mark",
            "row_content": "<p>Whether you're making your first custom shirt, running a growing apparel brand, or producing merchandise for customers, DTF gives you a flexible way to turn digital artwork into professional custom apparel.</p><p>With DESCECI, you can choose the ordering method that fits your workflow:</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        }
      },
